From 4273b296250f6fc8dee97fb595787e48aadaba12 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Moy Patel <on3moy@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 16:34:06 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add controller profiles and map_controller.py

Button numbers vary by pad, mode and OS, so configs now refer to buttons
by name ("LB", "RT") through a profile in controllers/. map_controller.py
records a profile: press a button, type its name. Ships a GameSir
Cyclone 2 profile seeded from the kernel (DS4 mode) and SDL XInput layouts.

Linux remote and picker resolve names via the profile; plain numbers still
work. The picker pins SDL to the kernel joystick driver so its numbers
match the evdev remote.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
